  "releaseNotes": "TinyDispatcher 1.3.0-beta.2\n\n      Added\n      - Dispatcher context identity on operation activities and metrics.\n      - Generated command and query structure through DispatcherPipelineBootstrap.GetOperations().\n\n      Notes\n      - Generated operation structure is lazy, deterministic, and independent from dispatch or runtime assembly scanning.\n      - Structure snapshots contain type identities and command/query metadata only; they do not expose operation payloads.\n      - 1.2.0 remains the current stable release.",
